<title>GERMANY: W.GERMAN IFO BUSINESS SEPT CLIMATE INDEX 95.7.</title>
<headline>W.GERMAN IFO BUSINESS SEPT CLIMATE INDEX 95.7.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German Ifo economics</p>
<p>institute gave the following data from its September business</p>
<p>climate survey:</p>
<p>    West Germany		   Sept 1996  Aug  1996</p>
<p>     Business climate	    95.7	 94.4</p>
<p>     Business conditions	 90.4	 89.1</p>
<p>     Business expectations     101.1	99.8</p>
<p>    East Germany		   Sept 1996  Aug  1996</p>
<p>     Business climate	    104.0	103.9</p>
<p>     Business conditions	 121.9	120.9</p>
<p>     Business expectations     88.3	 88.6 (revised)</p>
<p>NOTE - Economists and dealers expected a slight rise in the</p>
<p>west German business climate index to around 95 or slightly</p>
<p>higher.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
